==English==

===Etymology===
The phrase originated in Louisiana during the early 1950s when hunters would go out for the sole purpose of socializing while engaged in the sport of duck hunting, but instead paid little attention to their aiming and instead focused more on socializing with one another. As the reaction times of the hunters would be so slow due to their lack of attention, they would instead shoot where the ducks were, usually where they defecated.

